/*
 * FieldExpander — expands all field-access expressions into YIL values.
 *
 * The FieldExpander lowers high-level field access constructs into concrete
 * YILValue nodes. It handles:
 *
 *   - class field access,
 *   - closure field access,
 *   - struct field access,
 *   - tuple field access,
 *   - option field access,
 *   - future field access(value, finished, threadId),
 *   - class typeinfo access,
 *   - map length access,
 *   - enum field access(delegated to ValueExpander).
 *
 * Each field access is expanded into the appropriate YILFieldValue or
 * YILUnrefValue depending on the underlying type and access mode.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::value::field
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/value/field.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-23
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
